# Personal documents dropped in for local testing (e.g. a real resume) —
# never meant to be committed to this public repo.
myself/

# Real resume/CV files (.doc/.docx) used to test Resume Import, wherever
# they're dropped — blocked by extension, not just by directory, since
# these are personal data and this repo is public. Test fixtures build
# .docx files in-memory via python-docx (see tests/conftest.py's
# sample_docx_bytes), not from files on disk, so nothing legitimate needs
# to be committed with these extensions.
*.doc
*.docx
